+    `PrescribedExtinction.VacuumOutgoingWeakUniqueness, `PrescribedExtinction.WeakCurlFourier,
+    `PrescribedExtinction.WeakCurlLocalization, `PrescribedExtinction.WeakCurlPlaneWave,
